// THE OPTIONAL MINTS, not the raw arms: a branch that has to produce an optional uses these, because
// `Present { value: SomeType { ... } }` parses as a type annotation followed by a block (see the note at
// in_band_argv_credential_option). Absent/Present are still needed for MATCHING.
