// THE PRIVILEGE FACT IS NOT RE-MINTED HERE. §2: "Decomposing a leaf by minting a fresh authority for a
// concept that already exists is a failed decomposition." extdeps.bmc.ipmi_channel already publishes
// IpmiChannelPrivilegeLimit and the {channel, user, privilege} triple IpmiUserChannelAccess, and this
// module already takes IpmiUserId and IpmiChannelNumber from there. A Bool would collapse six published
// privilege levels into one bit -- NO ACCESS and OPERATOR indistinguishable -- and then need a validator
// for what the type could have carried. The carrier below embeds the triple rather than re-declaring its
// three fields.
import extdeps.bmc.ipmi_channel {
